<% content_for :preheader do %>Chicago sweeping is extended through Dec 17.<% end %>

<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  You're receiving this email because you subscribed to Chicago street sweeping alerts through <%= link_to ENV["SITE_NAME"], ENV["SITE_URL"] %> for <%= @street_address.presence || @area.name %>.
</p>

<p>
  The City has <%= link_to "extended street sweeping through Dec. 17", "https://chicago.suntimes.com/news/2026/11/19/chicago-extends-street-sweeping-to-week-before-christmas-as-leaves-linger-on-city-trees" %>—about a month past its usual Thanksgiving cutoff—to catch lingering leaves
  (<%= link_to "Sun-Times, Nov. 19", "https://chicago.suntimes.com/news/2026/11/19/chicago-extends-street-sweeping-to-week-before-christmas-as-leaves-linger-on-city-trees" %>).
  Extra sweeps will be scheduled ad hoc based on weather and crew capacity.
</p>

<p>
  When we reached out to the City's Open Data team, they informed us that the Department of Streets and Sanitation will <strong>NOT</strong> be updating the
  <%= link_to "2026 schedule dataset", "https://data.cityofchicago.org/Sanitation/Street-Sweeping-Schedule-2026/u5ai-3efk/about_data" %>
  that powers <%= ENV["SITE_NAME"] %>. Unfortunately, this means that schedules and email alerts here will miss those extra sweeps.
</p>

<p>
  Through Dec. 17, please watch for temporary orange signs on your block.
</p>

<% if @ward_office %>
  <p>
    Have feedback about late-season sweeping and the lack of a reliable schedule? Consider letting your alderperson know:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Ward <%= @ward_office[:ward] %> — Alderperson <%= @ward_office[:alderperson] %></li>
    <% if @ward_office[:phone] %><li>Phone: <%= @ward_office[:phone] %></li><% end %>
    <% if @ward_office[:email] %><li>Email: <%= mail_to @ward_office[:email] %></li><% end %>
    <% if @ward_office[:website] %><li>Website: <%= link_to @ward_office[:website], @ward_office[:website] %></li><% end %>
  </ul>
<% else %>
  <p>
    Have feedback about late-season sweeping and the lack of a reliable schedule? Consider contacting
    <%= link_to "your alderperson", "https://www.chicago.gov/city/en/about/wards.html" %>
    and asking for a permanently extended schedule.
  </p>
<% end %>

<%= render "shared/email_footer",
      disclaimer: true,
      manage_url: @manage_url,
      unsubscribe_url: @unsubscribe_url %>
